fvec3 get_spawn_position(plid pid) ->
Returns the default position <var>pid</var> should respawn at.
Usually passed as <var>pos</var> to spawn_player();

clk get_spawn_time(plid pid) ->
Returns the time when <var>pid</var> should respawn after being killed.
<!-- TODO: shouldn't -->
Returning 0 prevents respawn.

int get_hit_damage(plid pid, unsigned type) ->
Returns the amount of damage <var>pid</var> should do to another player given a type.
Possible values of <var>type</var> are:
<dl>
<dt>0<dd>Gun, torso
<dt>1<dd>Gun, head
<dt>2<dd>Gun, arms
<dt>3<dd>Gun, legs
<dt>4<dd>Spade
</dl>

plid assign_new_pid(void) ->
Returns a free pid to be passed to on_any_connect().
If no free pid in the range of 0 to MAX_PLAYERS&minus;1 inclusive can be allocated, returns MAX_PLAYERS.
